        },
        {
          "text": "Nyoonse nimufwa nyota, amuboole kumaanzi, Alakwe oyo uubula mali aze, Amuboole, muule, mulye, Amuboole, muule waini amalili, Zyoonse tazyuulwi mali, tazijisi muulo pe. ",
          "type": "text",
