              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ino musoowelanzi mali kukuula zintu zitali cilyo? Mubelekelanzi kukujana zintu zitakutyi? Amuswiililisye majwi aangu, mulye cilyo cibotu, myoyo yanu ikondwe kukusaninwa zintu zilweela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.55.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.55.2"
            ]
