        {
          "text": "Amupempeke matwi aanu, muboole kulindime. Amuswiilile, lino myuuya yanu iyoopona. Nkabela njootanga anywe cizuminano citamani, nkukuti luzyalo lusyomeka ndundafwida Davida. ",
