        {
          "text": "Ncobeni uyooita bamu mbotezi, abantu batakuzi bayoozuzaana nkobede, nkaambo ka-Jehova Leza wako, akaambo ka-Uusalala wa-Israyeli, nkaambo kakuti wakulemeka.",
          "type": "text",
