        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.8.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 8:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.3.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jer 3:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sizibi aleke inzila yakwe, asimilandu aleke miyeeyo yakwe, Aboole kuliJehova, kuti amufwide luzyalo, akuli-Leza wesu, nkaambo nguuinda kulekelela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.55.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.55.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 55:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo miyeeyo yangu tiili miyeeyo yanu, anzila zyanu tazyeensi inzila zyangu, mbwaamba Jehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.55.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.55.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 55:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo mbubonya mbuli ijulu mbulisumpwidwe kwiinda nyika, mbubonya obo inzila zyangu zilisumpwidwe kwiinda inzila zyanu amiyeeyo yangu kwiinda miyeeyo yanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.55.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.55.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 55:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.9.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kor 9:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbubonya mbuli imvula acivulamabwe mbuziloka kuzwa kujulu, alimwi tazipiluki nkuko, pele zilatilaila nyika akwiizyazya akwiisyusya, kuti ipe imbuto zyakubyala ansima yakulya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.55.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.55.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 55:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbubonya obo mbuliyooba ijwi lyangu lizwa kumulomo wangu, Talikooyooboola kulindime cabuyo pe, liyoozuzikizya makanze aangu akucita kabotu makani ngendalitumina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.55.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.55.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 55:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo muyoozwa alukondo akweenzegwa aluumuno. Zilundu atulundulundu zyoonse ziyoetalika kwiimba kubusyu bwanu, amisamu yoonse yamuzisaka iyookambilila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.55.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.55.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 55:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mucibaka camamvwa muyoomena musamu wakupresi, amucibaka camutubetube muyoomena muzimbwa, nkabela aya makani ayooletela Jehova impuwo, ayooba citondezyo citamani citakonzya kuloba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.55.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.55.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
